        "policy_M9ncjr": {
          "type": "policy",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Overview",
            "body": "<p>Welcome to LA STORY. In these Terms &amp; Conditions, “LA STORY,” “we,” “us” and “our” refer to the operator of this website. Our website, store, information, tools and related services are collectively referred to as the “Service.” Access to the Service is subject to these terms and the policies linked or referenced here.</p><p>When you browse our website, place an order or otherwise use the Service, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions (“Terms”). They apply to all website users, including customers, vendors, merchants and people who submit content.</p><p>Please read these Terms before using the website. If you do not accept them, you should not access the Service or make purchases through it. Where these Terms constitute an offer, acceptance is limited to these Terms.</p><p>Additional features and tools introduced to the store are also covered by these Terms. The current version will be available on this page; the section on changes below explains how updates are handled.</p><p>Our online store uses Shopify Inc.’s e-commerce platform to offer products and services.</p>",
            "action": "none"
          }
