            "body": "<p>By using the Service, you confirm that you have reached the age of majority where you live, or that you are an adult who has authorized a minor dependent to use the website under your supervision.</p><p>You must use our website and products only for lawful, authorized purposes. Your use must comply with applicable laws, including intellectual property laws. You may not introduce viruses, destructive code or other harmful software.</p><p>A violation of these Terms may result in suspension or termination of access to the Service, subject to applicable law.</p>",
