            "body": "<p>To the extent permitted by law, we may decline to provide service or restrict access to the website.</p><p>Operating the Service may require content to be transmitted across different networks and adapted to the technical requirements of connected devices. Payment information is handled through the payment services available at checkout. Please review our Privacy Policy for information about personal data.</p><p>Without our prior written permission, you may not copy, reproduce, resell or commercially exploit the Service, any part of it, or access to it. Section titles are included to make these Terms easier to navigate and do not change their meaning.</p>",
            "action": "none"
